                <note rend="inline" type="source">824.51/105: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Bolivia</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Cottrell</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-05-16T14:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 16, 1922—2
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>7. Your 15, May 2, 3 p.m.</p>
                <p>Attorneys for American bankers report their proposition accepted by Bolivian
                    representatives. Please keep Department advised of progress briefly by
                    cable.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
